        <li><a href="https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizgFBVV95cUxPWDJSamw5dldHNnNGdzVFdWZaV2JlSzBaNGxOTmlCTkVkVkxiV2lWRTRweHVBb05WVU1GQ0RjN3pxaDJhNlV4MUJaeDlKMHBjUm5HRUFOSG1NSWpOX0ljcVpMM0hvUTFKUmtkckFnVlVUYThYVktoOV9aM1NUa09uRTNuWmgxaGNyVDhKaG5MaG9VcFhjdEZPN0dDN3Vwa0Y1RDQwWnpFSUp0TzdWT2d2b1dxWm51X3BiSzByY0NEbEVkU09hU3EtYjktQlFXdw?oc=5" class="text-m-blue-light hover:text-primary transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">American Battery Technology assegura licença de exportação dos EUA — Seeking Alpha</a></li>
